        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Eastern Air Lines, American Airlines\n- Products: Eastern Air Lines Shuttle, American Airlines Shuttle, Trump Shuttle\n- People: Donald Trump\n- Places: Northeastern United States\n\nFacts:\n- Eastern Air Lines Shuttle was the brand name of Eastern Air Lines' air shuttle.\n- Eastern Air Lines Shuttle began operations on April 30, 1961.\n- Eastern Air Lines sold Eastern Air Lines Shuttle to Donald Trump in 1989.\n- Trump Shuttle later succeeded Eastern Air Lines Shuttle.\n- American Airlines Shuttle is the brand name for American Airlines' hourly air shuttle service in the Northeastern United States.",
